Oh, yeah.
對呀。

484
00:21:06,060 --> 00:21:07,200
I'll make some calls. Okay.
我幫你找找好嗎。好。

485
00:21:09,560 --> 00:21:10,920
Can you believe this is how we spent
你能想像得到我們的兩個禮拜

486
