Oh, and my purse, my purse, my purse,
喔，然後我的包包、我的包包....

509
00:22:35,960 --> 00:22:36,880
my purse, my purse, my purse.
包包阿。

510
00:22:38,900 --> 00:22:39,180
Sorry.
抱歉喔。

511
00:22:39,300 --> 00:22:39,440
Oh!
歐！

